		{"id":"b51f008a3eebfc8d","fromNode":"8dfc76221ee13ee9","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"bbc81ff466324abc","toSide":"top","label":"First Dual-Hop Paper\nImproves previous paper by around 2% in energy efficiency and "},
		{"id":"d5c2956b2152a78f","fromNode":"8dfc76221ee13ee9","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"f98c69a196f9ed39","toSide":"top"},
		{"id":"48e749de5ec3f18b","fromNode":"0cb003a6fcd54fb0","fromSide":"top","toNode":"8e9a5c938ed1962f","toSide":"bottom","label":"Attacks on Clock Sync:\nDoS\nByzantine Master\nControl Loop Interruption\nPacket Removal\nPacket Manipulation\nPacket Insertion\nSelective Packet Delay"},
		{"id":"11a6745d272a617a","fromNode":"0cb003a6fcd54fb0","fromSide":"top","toNode":"141a70339ae31f28","toSide":"bottom","label":"Delay Attacks\nReplay Attacks\nSpoofing\nForwarding/Blackhole Attacks"},
		{"id":"af005d4a4f90f4cb","fromNode":"0cb003a6fcd54fb0","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"f3b5666e8cd9369b","toSide":"top","label":"Tries to counter selective jammers while considering resources\n"},
		{"id":"fb9d78bcc8a93b63","fromNode":"0cb003a6fcd54fb0","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"43d2378e7b79aec7","toSide":"top","label":"Replaces a legitimate node at a specific time slot in the TDMA scheduling and transmits fake jamming and injection information\n\nFound an attacker can do considerable damage as the nodes send more fake data"},
		{"id":"9e5128b2009dce0b","fromNode":"8e9a5c938ed1962f","fromSide":"right","toNode":"141a70339ae31f28","toSide":"left"},
		{"id":"be089521785f26c8","fromNode":"141a70339ae31f28","fromSide":"left","toNode":"8e9a5c938ed1962f","toSide":"right","label":"Same Authors"},
		{"id":"18b03c801748e489","fromNode":"8dfc76221ee13ee9","fromSide":"top","toNode":"8e9a5c938ed1962f","toSide":"left","label":"Both Understand the importance of clock sync in WSNs using TDMA"},
		{"id":"fe9ebd972b7654a0","fromNode":"141a70339ae31f28","fromSide":"top","toNode":"8dfc76221ee13ee9","toSide":"top","label":"Instead of TDMA:\nRBS\nTPSN\nLTS\nMini-Sync\nTSPN"},
		{"id":"c2bf76d8bb7ab089","fromNode":"8dfc76221ee13ee9","fromSide":"right","toNode":"f3b5666e8cd9369b","toSide":"top","label":"Assumes only local synchronization"},
		{"id":"ca206a235e6f5ff2","fromNode":"40b38b61dd416660","fromSide":"top","toNode":"f3b5666e8cd9369b","toSide":"bottom","label":"JAMMY keeps a sliding history of it's slots. If it continually detects degradation, it *reacts*. \n1. Node A flags its slot is jammed\n2. Broadcasts a JAMMED_SLOT message to neighbors\n3. Selects a new slot not used in its 2-hop neighborhood\n4. Broadcast a NEW_SLOT message to confirm its reassignment"},
		{"id":"f51e147e5f32715f","fromNode":"8dfc76221ee13ee9","fromSide":"right","toNode":"43d2378e7b79aec7","toSide":"left","label":"Uses the Average Consensus Algorithm on top of TDMA"},
		{"id":"c1394dfa2f3624b6","fromNode":"40b38b61dd416660","fromSide":"left","toNode":"af3b23cd67cec407","toSide":"top","label":"Able to adapt to spectrum dynamically using TDMA, Game Theory, and Cognitive Radio (CR)\n\n\nThe core idea: Sensor nodes behave as rational agent* in a non-cooperative game, where each player (node) aims to maximize its own utility, balancing:\n- Energy consumption\n- Packet delivery\n- Security posture (e.g., avoidance of malicious behavior)\n"},
		{"id":"eb7126eea48a0e28","fromNode":"40b38b61dd416660","fromSide":"left","toNode":"83d614713e432946","toSide":"top","label":"AQL Coding and ASGWI clustering"},
		{"id":"214431ed22b246e1","fromNode":"40b38b61dd416660","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"06e379e1c7dbec84","toSide":"top","label":"Attacks:\n- false data injection\n- eavesdropping\n- node compromise\n\nSymmetric Key Encryption, Secure bootstrapping (where each shared key is already been shared), query dissemination"},
		{"id":"f23ed6c427db18b9","fromNode":"40b38b61dd416660","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"b9d96287e2d9b626","toSide":"top"},
		{"id":"5a5679ed81d8572b","fromNode":"40b38b61dd416660","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"0ae581ce68c3488b","toSide":"top"},
		{"id":"24e3b96caf14de1e","fromNode":"40b38b61dd416660","fromSide":"right","toNode":"161efef8b1746449","toSide":"top"},
		{"id":"15c1be2710d92a95","fromNode":"40b38b61dd416660","fromSide":"right","toNode":"4458bb978bb3fa51","toSide":"left"},
		{"id":"f87a69388aa65bc6","fromNode":"8dfc76221ee13ee9","fromSide":"left","toNode":"b5617b4e0c781792","toSide":"top","label":"Allows for a hardware \"fingerprint\" for each node to prevent spoofing"},
